{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：20:19 2026-07-23 HKT</p>\n\n<p>MIRROR成員陳卓賢（Ian）於啟德體藝館舉行一連九場《IAN CHAN：GROWTH LIVE 2026》演唱會，今日作為首場演出吸引大批粉絲提早數小時抵達，在啟德一帶為Ian造勢。幾百位Hellosss在零售館中庭及食肆等多個打卡位眾集影相留念，中庭位置設有多個人型紙牌、偶像歷程回顧及心意留言版等，粉絲亦排隊購買演唱會官方周邊產品。</p>\n<img alt=\" 陳卓賢啟德個唱今晚首場開鑼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f74ca9a206ce4bf463cb03d280a40261/2026-07/Ian_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"開場前五百Hellosss場外大合唱造勢。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b890788efcf479ca2f75c64a4e8e8644/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-23_at_19_42_01.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一連九場《IAN CHAN：GROWTH LIVE 2026》演唱會於啟德體藝館舉行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2eaa056421847198077b2ae792b10968/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-23_at_19_41_17_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大批粉絲提早數小時抵達。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0a7d404694ad13f42f11211a62680ed5/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-23_at_19_41_17.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場有唔少打卡位。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1a89771e7acd8f5c4ede99c93f935d5f/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-23_at_19_41_18.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有唔少偶像值得紀念靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ece3e727738bde9ce4800a5bf4fd1f15/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-23_at_19_41_19.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Hellosss打卡留念。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/938ffed65f75d87cf288265ce83cfc73/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-23_at_19_41_20_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一同沉浸於lan Chan Growth之中。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/426a6afa74a95d344ba980dd5f9824da/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-23_at_19_41_20_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"每晚安排不同的打卡應援佈置及紀念品派發。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/66226700aef84f4ac75f5cbdee05943b/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-23_at_19_41_20_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"就留待各位Hellosss到時入場揭盅了。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4652a6ec90a36845173cf2de7a4d5ffa/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-23_at_19_41_21.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"打卡位經過精心設計。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3d0a7e3b59729b802f8a7a7900721226/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-23_at_19_41_20.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"歌迷會及Hellosss合力在啟德零售館1地下中庭、啟德零售館2 Level 1及3，準備了20多個應援佈置。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/395bc52c00f9f284b39b7ce84c5b6208/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-23_at_19_41_23_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有好多Ian靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ae9bc00d4e1c8f9e59e9d673b98cc991/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-23_at_19_41_23_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場人頭湧湧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/abde1a3299328be0f56c9a08e2fb9f29/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-23_at_19_41_23.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"啟德都遍佈lan Growth的足跡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ec8ba481dd45a851526fb381eeca53b7/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-23_at_19_41_24.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"任何人士都可以一起打卡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0740b3c7bdc4fd49e8b741db9dc0e147/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-23_at_19_41_26_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"慶祝花籃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ef7fadb8886b8f8725296dd9cd45adee/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-23_at_19_41_55_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有官方周邊商品出售。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b6c94e9f1e83b97db2f016f6c14ff18f/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-23_at_19_41_55_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"商品獲Hellosss熱捧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f087c84b57046d2ff2aab733a855911b/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-23_at_19_41_55_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"粉絲亦排隊購買演唱會官方周邊產品。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5774e071c0b980d6b259a60630a06bdb/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-23_at_19_41_59_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屬Ian心血結晶。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/059fe8eaa44076901851193cd65fc87d/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-23_at_19_41_59.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>Hellosss合唱高呼口號為偶像打氣</h2>\n<p>演唱會開始前約一小時，陳卓賢國際歌迷會於體藝館對出公園樓梯集合，約五百位Hellosss手持燈牌與手燈等應援物，拍攝歌迷大合照，期間合唱並高呼口號「陳卓賢！一連九日我哋陪你一齊成長，7月23號Day 1 Good Show！」<br/> </p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-23T12:26:00.960060+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":330,"images":21,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}